# WWE Raw 2 (5451000D), Nova. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26, not
# played. One file: whether Raw 2 asks to create save data on first boot is
# not known; the step that would answer it has a frame, and a YES/NO there
# is answered with A.
#
# Evidence: titlebench hands-off 240 s (0-0-y-1790410659-titlebench-11,
# Nova), one frame per ~10 s in frames/: f03-f05 Anchor and Jakks logos,
# f06-f10 the intro FMV, f11-f12 "RAW 2 / Press START" (~110-120 s), f13-f15
# an FMV again, f16-f24 attract matches marked DEMONSTRATION. Nothing past
# the title is on disk: the menus below are [guess].
wait 60
shot boot60
press START                 # [guess] try to skip the intro FMV
wait 20
shot boot80
wait 25
shot boot105                # expect "Press START" [seen f11]; it gives way to an FMV by ~130 s
mark booted
press START
wait 8
shot after-title            # OPEN: a save-data prompt (YES/NO) or the main menu
press A                     # [guess] YES to a prompt, or the highlighted main-menu item
wait 8
shot menu1
press A                     # [guess] Exhibition / a single match
wait 6
shot menu2
press A                     # [guess] match type: one-on-one
wait 6
shot menu3
press A                     # [guess] wrestler (P1)
wait 5
shot select1
press A                     # [guess] opponent (CPU)
wait 5
shot select2
press A                     # [guess] arena / rules confirm
wait 5
shot select3
press START                 # [guess] "start match" on a confirm screen
wait 20
shot entrance
repeat 4 {
    press A                 # [guess] skip the entrances
    wait 8
    shot entrance-skip
}
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame of the match with both in the ring
# Walk at the opponent and mash the face buttons: strikes, grapples and
# reversals are among A/B/X/Y in this series.
repeat forever {
    axis LX max
    wait 0.8
    press X
    wait 0.3
    press A
    wait 0.3
    axis LX mid
    press B
    wait 0.3
    press Y
    wait 0.3
    axis LX min
    wait 0.8
    press X
    wait 0.3
    axis LX mid
    press A
    wait 0.5
}
